   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: same segments, other encoding",
   "originalText": "How it works: same segments, other encoding",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 943,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFC 9855 §7.2: \"the TI-LFA path computation algorithm is the same\". Only the encoding changes: each\nsegment becomes an IPv6 address (a SID) from a router’s locator.",
   "originalText": "RFC 9855 §7.2: \"the TI-LFA path computation algorithm is the same\". Only the encoding changes: each\nsegment becomes an IPv6 address (a SID) from a router’s locator.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 706,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "locator   router’s locator, else fc00:0:<SID index in hex>::/48   B:   fc00:0:4::/48\nEnd       node segment      = locator + function 1              B:   fc00:0:4::1\nEnd.X     adjacency segment = locator + 0x40 + the link’s place  B→A: fc00:0:4::40\n          among the router’s links (Adj-SID order: by neighbor, B→C: fc00:0:4::41\n          then link id)",
   "originalText": "locator   router’s locator, else fc00:0:<SID index in hex>::/48   B:   fc00:0:4::/48\nEnd       node segment      = locator + function 1              B:   fc00:0:4::1\nEnd.X     adjacency segment = locator + 0x40 + the link’s place  B→A: fc00:0:4::40\n          among the router’s links (Adj-SID order: by neighbor, B→C: fc00:0:4::41\n          then link id)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 317,
   "width": 543,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The repair list drops the destination’s own segment",
   "originalText": "The repair list drops the destination’s own segment",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 351,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With H.Encaps, S puts the original packet inside a new IPv6 header. D stays the inner packet’s address,\nso PrefixSID(D) isn’t needed in the list.",
   "originalText": "With H.Encaps, S puts the original packet inside a new IPv6 header. D stays the inner packet’s address,\nso PrefixSID(D) isn’t needed in the list.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 404,
   "width": 765,
   "height": 57,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "segments    [PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(E)]\nSR-MPLS     16004  24005  16002                 3 labels\nSRv6        [fc00:0:4::1, fc00:0:4::41]         2 SIDs, E stays the inner destination",
   "originalText": "segments    [PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(E)]\nSR-MPLS     16004  24005  16002                 3 labels\nSRv6        [fc00:0:4::1, fc00:0:4::41]         2 SIDs, E stays the inner destination",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a25-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 471,
   "width": 490,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Max SID depth counts SIDs pushed (RFC 9352 §4)",
   "originalText": "Max SID depth counts SIDs pushed (RFC 9352 §4)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
