  {
   "id": "a25-text-63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1054,
   "width": 1581,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 498897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6597927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "On SRv6, TI-LFA computes exactly the same repair; only the encoding changes. Segments become IPv6 SIDs from each router’s locator, and the destination stays the inner\npacket’s address. In Example 3 the 3-label MPLS stack becomes 2 SIDs, which fits an MSD of 2.",
   "originalText": "On SRv6, TI-LFA computes exactly the same repair; only the encoding changes. Segments become IPv6 SIDs from each router’s locator, and the destination stays the inner\npacket’s address. In Example 3 the 3-label MPLS stack becomes 2 SIDs, which fits an MSD of 2.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
